      "mergedPostDetails": "A niche problem, I had vrc+ and decided to categorize my own uploaded avatars in the favorites groups.\n\nRealized I could no longer turn into the avatar in recents, because I had lost my VRC+ subscription. An odd bug on it's own.\n\nThen I thought, wait a second. I uploaded that avatar, does it do that in the uploaded category? It does.\n\nI have no viable tester for quest, so I can't check if this affects both platforms",
